ET
BT
/F1 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.298 g
30. 75. Td
(No! BitGo's signature scheme approach to security depends on there not being a single point ) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.298 g
30. 60. Td
(of attack. But if your wallet password is on your KeyCard, then anyone who gains access to ) Tj
ET
